{"id":"u-70cd2767-adee-4e9e-8b6c-6b7c803600f5","src":"community","title":"The Iron Frequency 3-Day","author":"Bhavin S.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Qvq5UD-the-iron-frequency-5-day-1","desc":"The purpose of The Iron Frequency 3-Day Matrix is to compress a high-volume, multi-day strength routine into three hyper-focused, full-body sessions per week (Monday, Wednesday, Friday). It delivers maximum athletic output and muscle growth for anyone who wants to build a world-class physique without living in the gym.\nIt specifically achieves three crucial training goals:\n1. Guarantees 2x/Week Frequency: Traditional 3-day routines usually force you into a \"Full Body A/Full Body B\" cycle where you only hit certain muscles once a week. This matrix strategically cross-pairs your heavy barbell work, hypertrophy lifts, and ballistic finishes so that every single muscle group receives a growth signal exactly twice every 7 days.\n2. Optimizes Central Nervous System (CNS) Recovery: By pushing hard on training days and taking complete rest on Tuesdays, Thursdays, and weekends, your joints, tendons, and nervous system get a full 48 to 72 hours to rebuild. This completely eliminates chronic fatigue and allows you to lift significantly heavier on your primary strength sets.\n3. Erases Gym Friction: By enforcing a strict \"one equipment style per block\" rule during your grueling finishers, you never have to scramble across the gym to hoard multiple pieces of equipment. You complete your heavy lifts, grab your designated kettlebell or dumbbell, ignite a high-intensity metabolic burn, and walk out in under 50 minutes.","level":["Intermediate","Novice","Advanced"],"goals":["Olympic Weightlifting","Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-09T20:19:52.991Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4","Day 5"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n